==Danish==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|da}} {{m|non|í gær}}, {{m|non|í gjár||yesterday}} (whence Icelandic {{m|is|í gær}} and Faroese {{m|fo|í gjár}}).

===Phrase===
{{head|da|phrase|head=[[i]] [[går]]}}

# [[yesterday]] {{gloss|the day before today}}

